# Names and purposes only: never commit values.
# The offline registry validator reads no environment variables.
# The weekly model watch reads the following optional repository Actions secrets.
# Absent or whitespace-only means skip that vendor; there is no default key.
# OPENAI_MODELS_KEY: restricted OpenAI Models: Read key; model listing only.
# ANTHROPIC_MODELS_KEY: restricted Anthropic model-list key; scope must be checked.
# GEMINI_MODELS_KEY: restricted Generative Language model-list key; check scope.
# XAI_MODELS_KEY: restricted xAI model-list key; endpoint scope must be checked.
# DEEPSEEK_MODELS_KEY: restricted DeepSeek model-list key; scope must be checked.
# OpenRouter model listing is public and requires no key.
# See docs/model-watch.md for setup and unverified vendor restriction limits.
# Never put the registry signing key in CI or this file.
